   595	        """Build a deterministic default input set so the CLI can emit a
   596	        trainer-consumable snapshot without requiring upstream data.
   597	
   598	        Defaults seed a 60-bar OHLCV ramp, a balanced orderbook, a
   599	        higher-timeframe window, funding/OI/liquidation snapshots, and
   600	        no paper position. Ages are small (FRESH).
